        "approval_date": "2022-05-04",
        "description": {
          "text": "Converted accelerated approval to regular approval for HER2-positive breast cancer after two or more prior anti-HER2-based regimens in the metastatic setting",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "- **Supplement 017:** Provides for regular approval of Enhertu (fam-trastuzumab deruxtecan-nxki) for the treatment of adult patients with unresectable or metastatic HER2-positive breast cancer who have received two or more prior anti-HER2-based regimens in the metastatic setting. This indication initially received accelerated approval on December 20, 2019. We note that this indication is revised with S-020 and the final indication wording is reflected below.",
              "doc_id": "b09ca33c-5943-58ed-a736-da3a1954737b",
              "line": 7
